<title>USA: Cascade, Amfirst complete merger.</title>
<headline>Cascade, Amfirst complete merger.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Financial Corp, parent company of Washington-based Cascade Bank, and Amfirst Bancorp, parent of American First National Bank, completed their previously announced merger on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a statement, Cascade Bank now has assets of $433 million.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, roughly Cascade 800,000 common shares were issued to Amfirst shareholders for an exchange rate of 2.4 Cascade shares for each Amfirst share.</p>
